{"asset_key":"ep4/herohub_story_14411230","episode":"ep4","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"14411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1441123001:1":{"text":"It's nice to take a walk on the surface and get some fresh air.","source_cn":"偶尔到地面上散散步，透透气，真不错嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B639BA06E74DB04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1441123002:0":{"text":"What's this?","source_cn":"这是……<key:dialog141>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90DC6F3E16F32C6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1441123003:1":{"text":"This is the sea, and the sandy area beside it is called the beach. Those moving waters are the waves.","source_cn":"这是大海，这是沙滩，这是海浪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2587D24B41AEB499","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1441123004:1":{"text":"This is a turkey, and that one over there is a sheep. Those creatures flying in the sky are birds!","source_cn":"这是火鸡，这是绵羊，这是飞鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC480C5B23C4E98C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1441123005:1":{"text":"Everything's so new to you, right? You'll get the hang of it soon!","source_cn":"是不是还有很多问题想问？不着急，慢慢学。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC7F65C4648E855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1441123006:1":{"text":"Plus, this is just Brimstone Village, a tiny part of the world above ground!","source_cn":"这还只是深岩村这一小片地方，外面的世界大得很呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6812A7CCD5CA49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1441123006":{"text":"Plus, this is just Brimstone Village, a tiny part of the world above ground!","source_cn":"这还只是深岩村这一小片地方，外面的世界大得很呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6812A7CCD5CA49D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1441123007:1":{"text":"It's nothing like I imagined—but that's what makes it great.","source_cn":"是和想象中完全不同的世界……但这样就很好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC114AA602BBDCE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1441123008:1":{"text":"The races are different, and so is the environment. Still, it's just as vibrant and full of life as our world.","source_cn":"族群不同，环境不同，但却同样充满生机。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EA69DBDD10E93CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1441123009:1":{"text":"Is the outside world governed by a different set of rules?","source_cn":"外面的世界运行规则和萨洛克兰不同吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6868355C83858F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1441123009":{"text":"Is the outside world governed by a different set of rules?","source_cn":"外面的世界运行规则和萨洛克兰不同吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6868355C83858F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1441123010:1":{"text":"Now that I think about it, Feli was full of curiosity too when he first came above ground.","source_cn":"说起来，当初斐利尔来到地面上，也是这样问东问西呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x499630B2FE976E6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1441123011:1":{"text":"Feli had always been passionate about plants, and the beautiful scenes drawn in the manuscripts from our ancestors never failed to fascinate him.","source_cn":"斐利尔一直喜欢植物，好奇祖先手稿中的美丽景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E0030FA7F36FAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1441123012:1":{"text":"He would love it here.","source_cn":"他一定很喜欢这样的世界吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0293F122D6B41D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1441123013:1":{"text":"I'm sure some of us would love to make a home here.","source_cn":"我相信，一定会有艾塞勒，愿意生活在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E0BEEB569456AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"It's completely different.","source_cn":"完全不同","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x10889A1CADFC9E1D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's completely different.","female":"It's completely different.","variant_male_record_index":"71068","variant_female_record_index":"71069","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"It's similar in some ways.","source_cn":"有所相似","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5C892824EA4792","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's similar in some ways.","female":"It's similar in some ways.","variant_male_record_index":"71070","variant_female_record_index":"71071","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"What's your impression so far?","source_cn":"对地表世界的感想如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x860EB7F03C90EE45","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What's your impression so far?","female":"What's your impression so far?","variant_male_record_index":"71064","variant_female_record_index":"71065","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"Do you have lots of questions?","source_cn":"对地表有很多好奇的问题？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3AD700B61B60EB16","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Do you have lots of questions?","female":"Do you have lots of questions?","variant_male_record_index":"71066","variant_female_record_index":"71067","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":2}}